NOTICE
------
This repository serves as the official public showcase and technical
overview for Aegis Scam Firewall — an AI-powered on-device anti-fraud
firewall for mobile communications.

It contains high-level architecture specifications, threat model overviews,
benchmarking results, and release roadmap documentation ONLY.

The underlying proprietary machine learning model weights, Android 
telephony bridge engines, heuristic tokenizers, and production source code 
are maintained in the private primary repository and remain the exclusive 
intellectual property of Anbuselvan T.

